{"id":"0bc309d04895dc6e","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-book-tm-semantics.md","title":"第三版机器的双向带配置、运行与接受","display":"df-book-tm-semantics — 第三版机器的双向带配置、运行与接受","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-book-tm-semantics","aliases":["73-df-book-tm-semantics"],"display":"df-book-tm-semantics — 第三版机器的双向带配置、运行与接受","depends_on":["[[73-df-book-tm-structure]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.2.2–8.2.5, print pp. 326–334; PDF pp. 348–356; two-way infinite tape","source_status":"source-model-and-statement-checked; local finite-support representation","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§7.2, pp. 148–150; scans 156–158","legacy_source_status":"book-model-reconstructed","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-book-tm-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-book-tm-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-book-tm-semantics — 第三版机器的双向带配置、运行与接受"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d46ee2f661474682\" href=\"?note=d46ee2f661474682\" title=\"73-df-book-tm-structure\">73-df-book-tm-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.2.2–8.2.5, print pp. 326–334; PDF pp. 348–356; two-way infinite tape"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-model-and-statement-checked; local finite-support representation"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§7.2, pp. 148–150; scans 156–158"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-model-reconstructed"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\in\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\in\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d46ee2f661474682\" href=\"?note=d46ee2f661474682\" title=\"73-df-book-tm-structure\">73-df-book-tm-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(i,h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。一步关系与停机谓词的配置参数取下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\)</span>；输入占据从零开始的有限区间，两侧均为空白。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\coloneqq\\{(q,T,h):q\\in Q\\land T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\land|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\ne b\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\coloneqq\\{(q,T,h):q\\in Q\\land T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\land|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\ne b\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(q,T,h)\\to^B_M(p,T&#39;,h&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\;\\bigl[&amp;\n((q,T(h)),(p,a,d))\\in\\delta\\\\\n&amp;\\land((d=\\mathsf R\\land h&#39;=h+1)\\lor(d=\\mathsf L\\land h&#39;=h-1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;((i=h\\Longrightarrow T&#39;(i)=a)\\land(i\\ne h\\Longrightarrow T&#39;(i)=T(i)))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(q,T,h)\\to^B_M(p,T&#39;,h&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\;\\bigl[&amp;\n((q,T(h)),(p,a,d))\\in\\delta\\\\\n&amp;\\land((d=\\mathsf R\\land h&#39;=h+1)\\lor(d=\\mathsf L\\land h&#39;=h-1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;((i=h\\Longrightarrow T&#39;(i)=a)\\land(i\\ne h\\Longrightarrow T&#39;(i)=T(i)))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^B_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,D)\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M^2:C\\to^B_MD\\},\\qquad\nT_{M,w}^B(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\le i&lt;|w|,\\\\b,&amp;i&lt;0\\lor i\\ge|w|.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^B_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,D)\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M^2:C\\to^B_MD\\},\\qquad\nT_{M,w}^B(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\le i&lt;|w|,\\\\b,&amp;i&lt;0\\lor i\\ge|w|.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_B(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\;[\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land((q_0,T_{M,w}^B,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{BookConf}_M}(R^B_M)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_B(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\;[\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land((q_0,T_{M,w}^B,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{BookConf}_M}(R^B_M)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BookHalting}_M(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists D\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\;C\\to^B_MD.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BookHalting}_M(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists D\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\;C\\to^B_MD.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据第三版 pp.326–329，把旧笔记的自然数位置域改为整数位置域；在零格左移现在进入 −1 格，仍可继续运行。缺失转移才导致关系意义下的停机。接受定义为到达 F；可把首次到达 F 改成立即接受停机而不改变语言。有限支持带函数免除了纸面 ID 中前后空白的等价表示问题。空输入初始头位为零。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-book-tm-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d46ee2f661474682","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-book-tm-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-book-tm-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d46ee2f661474682","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\in\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-book-tm-structure]]；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$i,h,h'\\in\\mathbb Z$。闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。一步关系与停机谓词的配置参数取下述 $\\operatorname{BookConf}_M$；输入占据从零开始的有限区间，两侧均为空白。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\in\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-book-tm-structure]]；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$i,h,h'\\in\\mathbb Z$。闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。一步关系与停机谓词的配置参数取下述 $\\operatorname{BookConf}_M$；输入占据从零开始的有限区间，两侧均为空白。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\in\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"i,h,h'\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BookConf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\coloneqq\\{(q,T,h):q\\in Q\\land T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\land|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\ne b\\}|<\\aleph_0\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(q,T,h)\\to^B_M(p,T',h')\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\;\\bigl[&\n((q,T(h)),(p,a,d))\\in\\delta\\\\\n&\\land((d=\\mathsf R\\land h'=h+1)\\lor(d=\\mathsf L\\land h'=h-1))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;((i=h\\Longrightarrow T'(i)=a)\\land(i\\ne h\\Longrightarrow T'(i)=T(i)))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R^B_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,D)\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M^2:C\\to^B_MD\\},\\qquad\nT_{M,w}^B(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w(i),&0\\le i<|w|,\\\\b,&i<0\\lor i\\ge|w|.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"L_B(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\;[\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land((q_0,T_{M,w}^B,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{BookConf}_M}(R^B_M)]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BookHalting}_M(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists D\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\;C\\to^B_MD.","display":true}],"bytes":2636,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-book-tm-semantics|第三版机器的双向带配置、运行与接受]]"},{"id":"d2278db7a2867c72","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。第三版模型 $\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma},L_B$ 见 [[73-df-book-tm-semantics]]；双向无限带两终态规范模型的 $\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]。"},{"id":"ac868dc670f0e475","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d46ee2f661474682","25902d0bd75ea963"]}